#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:1
#: a5ac76194b164845a4e301f6a69c5f81
msgid "检查净力（Check net force）"
msgstr "Check net force"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:3
#: 236dd9b0501e463bb8f8d3ac8e56d5b6
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:5
#: b5f2d41d000c47a98c3d25f671bcca00
msgid "计算每个结构所有原子力的矢量和 `|ΣF|`，并选中超过阈值的结构。它常用于发现未满足平移不变性、 标签映射错误或 DFT 输出异常的数据。"
msgstr ""
"Compute the vector sum `|ΣF|` of all atomic forces in each structure and "
"select structures above a threshold. This often reveals broken "
"translational invariance, incorrect label mapping, or anomalous DFT "
"output."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:8
#: 5d497eb3eb804c34b3e9ef17a34c7c01
msgid "判定原理"
msgstr "Decision principle"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:10
#: 7b59a7a2135d4a14bc43312fd65314cf
msgid "对含 $N$ 个原子的结构，程序先求参考力的矢量和，再取欧氏模："
msgstr ""
"For a structure with $N$ atoms, the program sums the reference-force "
"vectors and then takes the Euclidean norm:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:12
#: 581ffc328720450b987f37a58a5df9d6
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{net}}=\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf F_i,\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{net}}=\\left\\|\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{net}}\\right\\|_2\n"
"=\\sqrt{F_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{net}}=\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf F_i,\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{net}}=\\left\\|\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{net}}\\right\\|_2\n"
"=\\sqrt{F_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2}.\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:18
#: e45a9998ad0b439fa1e714bafa7a8a85
msgid ""
"当 $F_{\\mathrm{net}}>F_{\\mathrm{threshold}}$ 时选中该结构。力的单位为 eV/Å，所以净力和阈值 "
"也都是 eV/Å。理想的孤立周期体系满足平移不变性时净力应接近零，但有限 SCF 精度、 "
"约束计算或外场也可能带来真实残差；这个工具是质量复核门槛，不是自动纠错器。"
msgstr ""
"Select the structure when $F_{\\mathrm{net}}>F_{\\mathrm{threshold}}$. "
"Force, net force, and the threshold are all in eV/Å. An ideal isolated "
"periodic system satisfying translational invariance should have nearly "
"zero net force, but finite SCF precision, constraints, or external fields"
" can produce real residuals. This tool is a review gate, not an automatic"
" correction."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:22
#: 1c032bc2a9c4454f87d0eae236c3db68
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:6775
#: b8b834b8ba1e461b883c29ff54a5944e
msgid "输入控件：`净力阈值`，即 `|ΣF|`。"
msgstr "Control: `Net-force threshold`, i.e. `|ΣF|`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:6776
#: 7dbad4b4561b4c378dd15d0bef014873
msgid "范围：`[0, 1e6]`，10 位小数。"
msgstr "Range: `[0, 1e6]`, with ten decimal places."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:6777
#: 89002a81c01242b79c195d3fde2b82d9
msgid "默认值：`1e-3`。"
msgstr "Default: `1e-3`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:6778
#: f25c3a643662482d99e7d555b2a2a73d
msgid "执行结果：选中超阈值结构，并显示统计消息。"
msgstr "Result: select structures above the threshold and show a summary message."

